# **PRODUK LINI BISNIS KIMIA**
Chandra Asri Group memiliki pabrik petrokimia yang terintegrasi. Hingga 2024, pabrik petrokimia yang dimiliki
- 1. Pabrik Olefins;
- 2. Pabrik Polyethylene;
- 3. Pabrik Polypropylene;
- 4. Pabrik Styrene Monomer;
- 5. Pabrik Butadiene;
  - 6. Pabrik MTBE & Butene-1.

# Fasilitas Pendukung:
Perseroan menggabungkan teknologi canggih dan fasilitas pendukung untuk menjalankan operasional kompleks petrokimia terintegrasi di Cilegon dan Serang.
- 1. On-site dan satellite warehouse;
- 2. Gas turbine generator;
- 3. Steam turbine generator; 4. Fasilitas water treatment;
- 5. Boiler;
- 6. Water cooling system; 7. Firefighting system.

# **Supporting Facilities:**
The Company combines advanced technology and supporting facilities to operate an integrated petrochemical complex operations in Cilegon and Serang. These facilities are:
- On-site and satellite warehouse; 2. Gas turbine generator;
- 3. Steam turbine generator;
- 4. Water treatment facility;
- 5. Boiler;
- 6. Water cooling system;
- 7. Firefighting system.

# Pengadaan Air
- Berfokus pada pengolahan air bersih dan khusus yang telah beroperasi lebih dari 40 tahun;
- Satu-satunya fasilitas terintegrasi di Indonesia, yakni dari hulu hingga hilir.
Hingga tahun 2024, kapasitas infrastruktur air Chandra Asri Group melalui perusahaan asosiasi KTI, antara lain:
- ~4.000 lpd kapasitas terpasang dan ~4.000 lpd kapasitas produksi air di wilayah Cilegon, Gresik, dan Sumbawa di wilayah Cilegon, Gresik, dan Sumbawa;
- Bendungan dengan luas kapasitas 5,4 juta meter kubik (m²);
   Water proprietary permits (IPSDA) dari Sungai Cidanau dan Sungai Cipasauran;
- Instalasi pengolahan air khusus, yaitu instalasi demineralisasi serta pengolahan air limbah.

### **Electricity Development**
- Focusing on energy provider, electrical services, and development of new renewable energy by utilizing solar power technology;
- Serving as the sole distributor of electricity throughout 2,666 Ha within the Cilegon area.
As of 2024, Chandra Asri Group's electricity infrastructure capacity includes:
- A power plant with Combined Cycle Power Plant (CCPP) technology that has a capacity of 120 MW;
- A Solar Power Plant (PLTS) for its own use and for tenants in the Krakatau Industrial Estate (KIK) with a total installed capacity of 2.2 MWp;
- An investment portfolio of equity participation in electricity assets with off-gas Steam Power Plant (PLTU) technology and a capacity of 200 MW totaling to 45% in the Joint Venture company PT Krakatau Posco Energy;
- A Transmission and Distribution Network to supply electricity in the Electricity Business Area served by the Company spanning an area of 2,666 Ha.

### Water Procurement
- Focusing on clean and special water treatment that has been operating for more than 40 years;
- Indonesia's only upstream-to-downstream integrated facility in Indonesia.
As of 2024, Chandra Asri Group's water infrastructure capacity through its KTI associate company includes:
- ~4,000 lps of installed capacity and ~4,000 lps of water production capacity in the areas of Cilegon, Gresik, and Sumbawa;
- A dam with a capacity of 5.4 million cubic meters (m²);
   Water proprietary permits (IPSDA) from the Cidanau River and Cipasauran River;
- Special water treatment installations, specifically, demineralization installations and wastewater treatment.

