- maupun tidak langsung, yang berkaitan dengan kegiatan usaha Perseroan;
- Tidak memiliki rangkap jabatan pada perusahaan lainnya yang terafiliasi dengan Perseroan; dan
- Mengerti peraturan perundang-undangan di bidang pasar modal.

# Independent Commissioners' Criteria
All of the Company's Independent Commissioners have complied with the following provisions of Financial Services Authority Regulation No. 33/POJK.04/2014 on Board of Directors and Board of Commissioners of Issuer or Public Companies:
- Has no authority and responsibility to plan, lead, control, or supervise the Company's activities 6 (six) months prior to their first appointment;
- Has no shares in the Company, either directly or indirectly;
- Has no affiliation with the Company, its Board of Commissioners, its Board of Directors, or its majority shareholders;
- Has no business relationship, either directly or indirectly, related to the Company's business activities;
- Has no concurrent positions at other companies affiliated with the Company; and
- Understands laws and regulations in the field of capital markets.

